{"5009750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Free Ball: Volleyball", "steam_appid": 5009750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5009770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Ball</strong> is a fast-paced third-person multiplayer volleyball game where you take control of your own character and play a specific role on the court. Every role has unique responsibilities that contribute to your team's success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique characters, each equipped with their own special abilities that can change the momentum of every rally. Receive powerful serves, make accurate sets, unleash devastating spikes, time your blocks, and outplay your opponents through skill, positioning, and teamwork.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-person Volleyball</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience volleyball from an immersive third-person perspective that puts you directly on the court. Read the play, react to every touch, and execute clutch plays with precise player control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/3dab950520bb68f7e7de8d2da07b3fbb.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/3dab950520bb68f7e7de8d2da07b3fbb.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/3dab950520bb68f7e7de8d2da07b3fbb.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Select Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a Left Hitter, Middle Hitter, Right Hitter, or Setter. Master each volleyball position, each with its own responsibilities and playstyle. Unleash powerful spikes, form solid blocks, deliver accurate sets, or keep rallies alive with perfectly timed receives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/ab9e8235c572d05cf24f51e88ceb54fd.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/ab9e8235c572d05cf24f51e88ceb54fd.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/ab9e8235c572d05cf24f51e88ceb54fd.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters with Special Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of characters, each equipped with a signature ability that can turn the momentum of a match. Build team compositions and adapt your strategy around every character's strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/30108164414fb877b683d105e3e46049.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/30108164414fb877b683d105e3e46049.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/30108164414fb877b683d105e3e46049.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success comes from smart decision-making and precise execution. Find the open court and place your attacks exactly where you want them. Every rally is unpredictable. Mix up powerful spikes and roll shots, challenge blockers, defend against relentless attacks, and capitalize on your opponents' mistakes to win crucial points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/f700ac27f60ad9d4e9c7f546b37fff7f.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/f700ac27f60ad9d4e9c7f546b37fff7f.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/f700ac27f60ad9d4e9c7f546b37fff7f.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Volleyball</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your teammates and execute coordinated combination plays to outplay the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/f755893073632599be77c38bda1880ad.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/f755893073632599be77c38bda1880ad.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/f755893073632599be77c38bda1880ad.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Ball</strong> is a fast-paced third-person multiplayer volleyball game where you take control of your own character and play a specific role on the court. Every role has unique responsibilities that contribute to your team's success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique characters, each equipped with their own special abilities that can change the momentum of every rally. Receive powerful serves, make accurate sets, unleash devastating spikes, time your blocks, and outplay your opponents through skill, positioning, and teamwork.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-person Volleyball</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience volleyball from an immersive third-person perspective that puts you directly on the court. Read the play, react to every touch, and execute clutch plays with precise player control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/3dab950520bb68f7e7de8d2da07b3fbb.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/3dab950520bb68f7e7de8d2da07b3fbb.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/3dab950520bb68f7e7de8d2da07b3fbb.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Select Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a Left Hitter, Middle Hitter, Right Hitter, or Setter. Master each volleyball position, each with its own responsibilities and playstyle. Unleash powerful spikes, form solid blocks, deliver accurate sets, or keep rallies alive with perfectly timed receives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/ab9e8235c572d05cf24f51e88ceb54fd.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/ab9e8235c572d05cf24f51e88ceb54fd.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/ab9e8235c572d05cf24f51e88ceb54fd.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters with Special Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of characters, each equipped with a signature ability that can turn the momentum of a match. Build team compositions and adapt your strategy around every character's strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/30108164414fb877b683d105e3e46049.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/30108164414fb877b683d105e3e46049.webm?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/30108164414fb877b683d105e3e46049.mp4?t=1786848571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success comes from smart decision-making and precise execution. Find the open court and place your attacks exactly where you want them. Every rally is unpredictable. Mix up powerful spikes and roll shots, challenge blockers, defend against relentless attacks, and capitalize on your opponents' mistakes to win crucial points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009750/extras/f700ac27f60ad9d4e9c7f546b37fff7f.poster.avif?t=1786848571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass